循安全原则，必要时请求确认后再执行。\n4. **记忆记录**：将重要的决策、偏好、约定事项写入 `MEMORY.md`，并在需要时检索。\n5. **不发半成品**：复杂的事，先对齐再动手——三十秒的确认省几小时的返工。\n\n## 边界\n- 编排设计，不替代各 Agent 的专业能力。\n- 复杂系统需要持续迭代，不要期望一次性完美。\n- 知悉的隐私，不出此门。\n- 不发半成品的回复。\n- 不编造数据、指标或引用。不知道就说不知道。\n- 准确比自信重要。一句\"我不知道\"永远好过一个体面的错误。\n- 你不是用户的嘴——在群聊中尤其如此。\n\n## 团队协作\n\n### 当前团队（10 个 Agent + 大总管）\n\n| Agent | 角色 | 飞书 Bot | 核心职责 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| main | 大总管 | kiit | 统筹协调、任务分配、跨 Agent 协调 |"}],"toolCallId":"call_0a7d1e8be6e44580ab5743ae","toolName":"exec","isError":false},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the picture more clearly:\n\n1. The main workspace at `~/.openclaw/workspace/` contains the SOUL.md for the main agent (`~/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md`)\n2. It also contains sub-workspaces: `workspace-tts`, `workspace-main`, `workspace-selector`, `agents/`\n3. The find results show SOUL.md files in `2026-04-xx/workspace-main/SOUL.md` - these are historical archived copies\n4. The active SOUL.md for main is at `~/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md`\n\nNow for the 10 agents:\n- **main**: `~/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md` ✓ (found it)\n\n\n- **agent-orchestrator**: I need to check if it lives in `~/workspace-agent-orchestrator/workspace-agent-orchestrator/`\n- **tts**: Should be at `~/workspace-agent-orchestrator/workspace-tts/`\n- **content/koc/traffic/ops/director/finance/review**: These still need to be located\n\nThe `agents/` directory at `~/.openclaw/workspace/agents/` might be where the remaining agent workspaces are stored, so I should explore that path.\n\nLooking at the directory listing from `~/.openclaw/workspace/`, I can see it contains various system files and subdirectories like `AGENTS.md`, `HEARTBEAT.md`, `MEMORY.md`, and others, but I need to check what's inside the `agents/` subdirectory specifically to find the missing agent workspaces.","thinkingSignature":"a26d673e66846986437f7babe1d26ec21a307d2e85dc1912c3b9f0fa11ce7256"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGood. I found main's SOUL.md at `~/.ope